{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The Reunion"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Remember That Time ... ?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 18}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations"}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le18ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "What are Idioms?"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Idioms are expressions which have a meaning apart from what the words themselves mean."}, {"type": "text", "content": "They are very common in spoken English. It is important to know some idioms and to remember that the meaning of the words as a group is different from the words individually. <br>Here are some idioms you can use with friends:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Idiom \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A friend in need is a friend indeed.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When people are in need, true friends will always come to their aid. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Friends in high places\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Having friends in high places means someone knows people with power and influence. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Be an item\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When two people start a romantic relationship, they are an item.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Birds of a feather\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"As the saying goes, birds of a feather flock together, similar people get along well.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "How's life treating you?"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "How are you?; What's new? "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Long time no see! How's life treating you?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to catch up with friends."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": " to steal"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to talk something that does not belong to you "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You stole my seat."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "whirlwind "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " busy experience "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I had a whirlwind trip around the world."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "abroad"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " overseas; in another country "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I had a an excellent vacation abroad."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to seem "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to appear "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The chair seemed to be free."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "trusting "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " easy to trust other people "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I used to be more trusting back in those days."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Past Time Expressions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">three years ago</span> or <span class=\"italic\">last year</span> when you talk about the past.<br><br>  You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">in 2012</span> when you talk about a year in the past.<br><br>  You use <span class=\"italic\">When I was \u2026 </span> to talk about a period of time."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Expression \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" in \u2026 (month or year)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I went to Paris in 2012.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" last \u2026 (day, month, time, etc.) \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> He ripped the jacket last year.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"(number of months or years) \u2026 ago\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I bought this jacket 2 months ago.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Read each situation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose one and role play the situation with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Change roles and practice again."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 1</span>: You are walking on the street when you see an old friend. Say hello and update them about your life.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 2</span>: You are walking on the street when you hear your name. You turn around and see an old friend. Ask them about their life. \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I choose one role and act it out."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice seeing an old friend."}, {"type": "text", "content": "My partner and I switch roles."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le18ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le18ob03re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le18ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Peter! Hey! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Sally! Vanessa! My friends! How are you guys doing? Long time no see. You both look great.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So good to see you, Pete. You look good, too. How's life treating you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, you know. Busy with work and stuff. Let's not talk about my boring life ... what's new with you guys?", "id": 1, "time": "2000", "image": "engenn5le18ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I came back last month from my whirlwind trip abroad. Oh, that reminds me ... this is for you.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, hey it's just like that jacket I ripped.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, it's a French designer!", "id": 2, "time": "23500", "image": "engenn5le18ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thanks, Sal. It's super nice. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: A friend in need is a friend indeed.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Weren't you wearing it when we met at Ned's Cafe?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh yeah. I was studying when you came in and stole the seat next to me. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I didn't take it. You offered it to me!", "id": 3, "time": "36000", "image": "engenn5le18ob03re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's what it seemed like. I was just being polite. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I used to be more trusting back in those days ... I don't think I would do that now. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sure, V. I'm sure Marco would disagree with that.", "id": 4, "time": "53000", "image": "engenn5le18ob03re2img06.jpg"}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can use expressions to indicate the past. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk or report about actions, events or people. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "  I can say what I was doing when something else happened. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "  Is there someone who you don't see often? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "  Who is it? What are they like?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": " Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Long time no see! "}